<Rescue title="About us" description="About Maple Hollow Animal Rescue.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About Maple Hollow Animal Rescue</h1>
    <p>Maple Hollow Animal Rescue is a fictional nonprofit, made up to show Nest Co.'s website and software work. The details here are invented.</p>
    <h2>What this site demonstrates</h2>
    <p>The volunteer sign-up and coordinator pages are a small working tool: shifts, spots left, sign-up and cancel, a coverage view and a CSV export. Here the data stays in your browser. For a real organization the same screens would connect to a database or an existing system, with staff logins, email confirmations and reminders.</p>
  </div>
</Rescue>
